---
import SectionTitle from "./SectionTitle.astro";
---

<section class="px-6 pt-20 pb-16">
  <SectionTitle en="Dress Code" ja="服装について" />

  <div class="mx-auto mt-8 flex justify-center gap-8 text-deep-red" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg
      class="h-12 w-12"
      viewBox="0 0 48 48"
      fill="none"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="1.3"
      stroke-linejoin="round"
    >
      <path d="M24 24L9 15v18l15-9 15 9V15z"></path>
      <rect x="21" y="21" width="6" height="6" rx="1.8" fill="currentColor"></rect>
    </svg>
    <svg
      class="h-12 w-12"
      viewBox="0 0 48 48"
      fill="none"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="1.3"
      stroke-linejoin="round"
    >
      <path d="M19 6v6l-2 8h14l-2-8V6"></path>
      <path d="M17 20l-7 22h28l-7-22"></path>
      <path d="M19 12h10"></path>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-sm text-center text-sm leading-loose tracking-wider text-ink">
    恐れ入りますが、平服ではなく正装にて<br />ご参列いただけますと幸いです。
  </p>
  <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-sm text-center text-sm leading-loose tracking-wider text-ink">
    会場には控え室がございますので<br />お着替えが必要な方はご利用ください。
  </p>
</section>
